			"notes": "## Better With Silence v1.2.0\n\nAdds the **Acoustic Dampener** block — silences all sounds within an 8-block radius.\n\n### Features\n- Complete sound silencing within 8 blocks\n- Toggle on/off with right-click (click sound always plays)\n- Active by default when placed\n- Hostile mob sounds always pass through (creepers, zombies, skeletons, etc.)\n- Mineable by axe (faster with better tiers)\n\n### Crafting\nOak Planks + Wool + Slimeball\n\n### Dependencies\n- [Babric](https://github.com/Turnip-Labs/bta-fabric-instance-repo/releases) (Fabric loader for BTA)\n- [HalpLibe](https://github.com/Turnip-Labs/bta-halplibe/releases) 5.4.0+"
		}
